        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliyashibu umuherezi mukuru na bagenziwe b’abaherezi bava hasi barakora, bubaka Irembo ry’Intama. Barishikiriza Imana bashirako n’inzugi, barubaka bashika ku Munara wa Meya, bahashikanira Imana, no gushika ku Munara wa Hananeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu b’i Yeriko bubaka igice co hagati, Zakuri na we mwene Imuri yubaka i ruhande yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irembo ry’Amafi ryubakwa na bene Hasenaya. Bashiraho imyamba basakarirako baca batera inzugi bashiraho n’ibihindizo vyo kugumya urugi iyo rwugaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meremoti mwene Uriya, mwene Hakozi, asanura igice gikurikira. Akurikirwa na Meshulamu mwene Berekiya, mwene Meshezabeli, arasanura, akurikirwa na Zadoki mwene Bayana na we nyene arasanura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igice gikurikira gisanurwa n’abantu b’i Tekowa, ariko abubahwa babo ntibagira ico bakora ngo bumvire umukuru wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irembo Rishaje, ari ryo rya Yeshana, risanurwa na Yohiyada mwene Paseya hamwe na Meshulamu mwene Besodeya. Bashiraho ibishimaryango, baterako inzugi, bashiraho n’ibihindizo vyo kugumya urugi iyo rwugaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakurikirwa n’abantu b’i Gibeyoni n’i Misipa, Melatiya w’i Gibeyoni na Yadoni w’i Meronoti, batwarwa n’umukuru atwara intara zo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziyeli mwene Harihaya, umwe mu bacuzi b’inzahabu, asanura igice gikurikira; na Hananiya, umwe mu bahinga bahingura ibimota neza, asanura ahakurikira aho. Basanura Yerusalemu gushika ku ruzitiro rwagutse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Refaya mwene Huri, yaganza igice kimwe c’i Yerusalemu, asanura igice gikurikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ruhande yabo, Yedaya mwene Harumafi asanura ahatumberanye n’inzu yiwe, Hatushi mwene Hashabuneya na we asanura igice gikurikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malikiya mwene Harimu na Hashubi mwene Pahati-Mowabu asanura ikindi gice n’umunara w’amatanure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu mwene Haloheshi, uwaganza igice kimwe c’i Yerusalemu, asanura igice gikurikira afashijwe n’abakobwa biwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
