          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalewi barongowe na Rehumu mwene Bani barakurikira barasanura. Bakurikirwa na Hashabiya, uwaganza igice c’intara ya Keyila, arasanura ku bw’akarere abamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurikira n’abandi benewabo b’Abalewi bari barongowe na Binuwi mwene Henadadi, uwaganza ikindi gice c’ako karere k’i Keyila, barahasanura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurikira Ezeri mwene Yesuwa, uwaganza i Misipa, asanura igice gikurikira, uhereye aharabana n’ingazi yo ku bubiko bw’ibigwanisho kugeza aho uruzitiro rukatira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurikira Baruki mwene Zakayi akorana umwete mu gusanura ikindi gice, kuva aho uruzitiro rukatira gushika ku rwinjiriro rw’inzu ya Eliyashibu umuherezi mukuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurikira Meremoti mwene Uriya, mwene Hakozi, asanura ikindi gice, kuva ku rwinjiriro rw’inzu ya Eliyashibu gushika aho ruherera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
