          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakurikiye mu gusanura bari abaherezi bo mu karere kahakikuje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakurikirwa na Benyamini na Hashubi, basanura imbere y’inzu yabo; baca bakurikirwa na Azariya mwene Mayaseya, mwene Ananiya, asanura i ruhande y’inzu yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akurikirwa na Binuwi mwene Henadadi, asanura ikindi gice, uhereye ku nzu kwa Azariya gushika aho uruzitiro rukatira no mu mfuruka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maze Palali mwene Uziya akora aharabana n’aho uruzitiro rukatira n’umunara urabana n’ikirimba co haruguru hafi y’urugo rw’umurinzi. Hakurikira Pedaya mwene Paroshi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.25"
            ]
