          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakurikirwa na Zadoki mwene Imeri, asanura aharabana n’inzu yiwe, Akurikirwa na Shemaya mwene Shekaniya, umurinzi wo kw’Irembo ryo mu Buseruko, arahasanura. ",
          "type": "text",
