          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malikiya, umwe mu bacuzi b’inzahabu arakurikira, asanura gushika ku nzu y’abakozi bo mu Ngoro n’abadandaza, aharabana n’Irembo ry’Ubugenduzi, no gushika ku cumba kiri hejuru y’aho uruzitiro rukatira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
